"On (Advanced Consent Mode): the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load "
"right away. Until the visitor accepts, they set no cookies and send Google "
"only cookieless pings, which Google uses to model the missing data. Google "
"Analytics and Google Ads expect this mode, and with Basic mode they can "
"report your consent signals as not active."
